data: {"id": "c71caf76bfd14549-thinking-parallel_evidence-919", "run_id": "c71caf76bfd14549", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将严格按照证据计划执行，先并行采集 Kubernetes 层面的关键事实（describe、events、nodes），同时处理 observability gate 中的日志失败问题。\n\n**第一轮执行说明：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 获取 Pod 调度失败详细原因\n2. `kubectl_events` - 获取 FailedScheduling 事件\n3. `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_cluster` - 获取节点资源状态\n4. `execute_pod_promql` - 获取 Pod 状态和 CPU 请求（基线）\n5. 日志因权限问题报错，先跳过，依赖 kubectl logs 作为备选；Trace 结果为空（Pod Pending 无 IP，属预期）\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788409793113, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

