event: thinking
data: {"id": "c71caf76bfd14549-thinking-parallel_evidence-2413", "run_id": "c71caf76bfd14549", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，现在信息清楚了：\n\n## 调查结果\n\n### 关于 `query_pod_logs` 失败\n`query_pod_logs` 工具的错误实际上反映的是日志采集基础设施（elasticsearch-master-0）在 `monitor` 命名空间中的权限问题，**不是**目标 Pod `workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 的日志查询失败。这是 observability 基础设施的问题，不影响对目标 Pod 的诊断。\n\n### 目标 Pod 真实状态（已确认）\n\n通过 `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl logs` 获取到关键事实：\n\n1. **Pod 状态**: `Pending`，`node: <none>` — 未被调度到任何节点\n\n2. **调度失败原因**: \n   - 事件: `FailedScheduling` - `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n   - 关键约束: **Node-Selectors", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788409818550, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

